# Design system

## Writing

- **Never use em dashes (—) or en dashes (–)** in copy, metadata, or comments. Use a plain hyphen `-`, a colon, a full stop, or `|` in titles. The owner sees em dashes as an "AI-written" tell.

## Theme

- **Light and dark** via CSS variables in `globals.css` (`:root` / `.dark`); default follows the device (`defaultTheme="system"`); toggle in `SiteNav`
- Accent: confident blue (`--accent`: `#2563eb` light / `#60a5fa` dark) plus cyan `--accent-2` used **only** in gradients (hero rotating word, glow blobs)
- Avoid purple-on-black "AI slop" gradients
- Surfaces: `bg-background`, `bg-card` for cards, `bg-band` for alternating sections (Experience, Projects, Know me); borders `border-border`; hover `hover:border-accent/40`

## Typography

- One sans stack (Geist) plus Geist Mono for small meta (section index "01", periods, coordinates)
- Section header: mono accent index + `text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight` h2
- Hero name: `text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-8xl tracking-tighter`; body max-width ~`max-w-2xl`

## Layout patterns

- **Home (`/`):** hero, about, experience (timeline), education (CGPA cards), side projects, skills (chip cards), know me (quote + fact cards), footer (`#contact`)
- **Bento pattern (archive):** 12-column grid, `rounded-3xl` cards, varied `col-span`
- Section ids used by nav: `about`, `experience`, `education`, `projects`, `skills`, `know-me`, `contact`
- Sections: `scroll-mt-28 py-20 sm:py-28`, container `max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6`
- Mobile: nav links collapse into `MobileMenu` below `md`

## Motion & a11y

- Intensity: **subtle** (owner's choice). One signature moment: the hero (dot grid that lights up around the cursor, drifting glows, rotating topic word, GSAP entrance)
- One repeated interaction: `Spotlight` cards (border + surface glow follows the mouse; hover devices only). Use it for every card instead of inventing new hover effects
- Section-specific: experience timeline line fills on scroll and dots pop in (`ExperienceTimeline`); skills chips show where each skill was used (`SkillsExplorer`, derived from `experience.ts` plus `skillAliases`); About has an "At a glance" panel derived from content
- Everything else is a calm `Reveal` fade-up on scroll
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: `MotionConfig reducedMotion="user"`, GSAP and the rotating word skip, CSS drift disabled
- Rotating text must have an `sr-only` full sentence; decorative layers are `aria-hidden`
- No ENTER splash gates; no full-page WebGL/Three.js unless explicitly requested
- GSAP: `gsap.context` + cleanup in `useEffect`

## Components

- Shared chrome: `SiteNav`, `SiteFooter`, `ContactEmail`, `MobileMenu`, `ThemeToggle` in `components/shared/`
- Section blocks: `components/shared/sections.tsx`; scroll animation wrapper `Reveal.tsx`; reuse before forking layouts
